OL,3,GNEWSAHousing plan near palace sees
OL,4,Aparking scaled back
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to scale back the parking spaces
OL,7,Fof a housing scheme opposite Hampton
OL,8,FCourt Palace have been submitted to the
OL,9,Fcouncil.
OL,11,FThe new proposal for the former Jolly
OL,12,FBoatman pub site in East Molesey, sent
OL,13,Fto Elmbridge Borough Council, would cut
OL,14,Fthe originally agreed 207 parking
OL,15,Fspaces down to 93.
OL,17,FThe planning application cited
OL,18,Fincreased costs and slow sales for the
OL,19,Fdecision, according to the Local
OL,20,FDemocracy Reporting Service (LDRS).
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
