OL,3,GNEWSAHousing plan near palace sees
OL,4,Aparking scaled back
OL,5,
OL,6,FA South Western Railway and Network
OL,7,FRail Wessex spokesperson said it was
OL,8,Fworking with authorities involved to
OL,9,Fconsider the plans and "ensure the
OL,10,Fneeds of customers, local residents and
OL,11,Fthe wider community are properly taken
OL,12,Finto account".
